        <p class="eyebrow"><span></span> Know where the data goes</p>
        <h1 itemprop="headline">What makes a weight tracker private?</h1>
        <p itemprop="description">&ldquo;Private&rdquo; should describe concrete behavior: where entries are stored, which services receive them, what permissions the app requests, and how you can take your history with you.</p>
    </header>

